```catala
scope AllowanceWitness21:
  definition result
    equals
      (output of Allowance with { -- h: Household { -- status: Pensioner -- weekly_income: 401.0 -- has_dependants: true } }).allowance
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope AllowanceWitness21 --disable-warnings -F json
{"result":"0"}
```

